  "instructions": "Complete `mixins.py`, `audit_protocol.py` and `gateway.py`. `LoggingMixin` and a cooperative `AuditMixin` add capabilities, `Auditable` is a runtime-checkable `Protocol`, and `PaymentGateway` is an ABC that registers named subclasses. The three gateways must log and audit in both `process_payment` and `refund`, and `run_audit_check` must accept anything with `record_audit`.",
